This paper frames the PRE task as an \emph{incomplete multimodal learning} problem \cite{conf_kdd_WangZTZ20, conf_kdd_ChenZ20}.
To tackle this challenge, one possible approach is to generate missing multimodal data~\cite{hgan, cycae, smil}.  
%by learning the correlation between modalities
