\noindent \textit{\textbf{Regional Generalization.}}
While the selected region already covers diverse precipitation regimes from tropical to temperate zones, we further evaluate the generalization capability of PRE-Net. Specifically, we conducted experiments over Australia (10–40°S, 113–153°E) during 2022-12-01 to 2023-02-28 wet season. All evaluations are conducted using station-level ground truth data from the Integrated Surface Dataset (ISD) maintained by the National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration (NOAA). Compared with IMERG, PRE-Net outperforms IMERG across all key metrics, as shown in \ref{tab:australia}. These results demonstrate PRE-Net's potential for global deployment.

