    \ref{sol:3} \textit{ULCL}        & Integrated  & Yes                 & Complex UPF/SMF rules                & Yes     & No          \\
    \ref{sol:4} \textit{Multihoming} & Integrated  & Partial             & PDU Session reconf. (UE IPv6 Prefix) & Yes     & Partial     \\
