\begin{prop} \label{prop:enlarge_quad}
    Suppose that \eqref{eq:dVP} holds. Then, the set $ \mathbf{V}_{c_2} := \{x\in \mathbb{R}^n:\,V_P(x)\le c_2\}$ is a safe ROA of \eqref{eq:System}. 
