\caption{(a) Errors in the solutions to \cref{abel} for $\lambda = 2$ obtained by the SS, JFP, and GLOFPG methods. For the GLOFPG method, we use the GLOF basis with parameters $\alpha = 0$, $\beta = 5$, and $\lambda = 0$, where $\alpha$, $\beta$, and $\lambda$ follow the notations in \cite[\S 3]{che2} and are not those used elsewhere in this paper. (b) Execution times for the GLOFPG method and for the JFP method constructed via different algorithms.}\label{fig:fie}
